1
00:00:08,341 --> 00:00:10,931
[JOHN WILLIAMS' "THE IMPERIAL
MARCH" PLAYING OVER SPEAKER]

2
00:00:21,980 --> 00:00:24,650
(Leonard:)Will you please turn your shirt off?

3
00:00:25,066 --> 00:00:27,356
(Raj:)What? I'm giving myself
dramatic entrance music.

4
00:00:27,527 --> 00:00:31,117
(Raj:)People will know I'm awesome
and to be feared.

5
00:00:31,281 --> 00:00:33,871
(Howard:)Right. There's nothing more awesome
and frightening...

6
00:00:34,034 --> 00:00:37,994
(Howard:)...than a man who's got music blasting
from between his nipples.

7
00:00:38,163 --> 00:00:39,203
[MUSIC STOPS]

8
00:00:39,372 --> 00:00:42,292
(Leonard:)-Hey, Stuart. What's going on?
-Well, you might wanna mark...

9
00:00:42,459 --> 00:00:46,419
(Stuart:)...your Google calendars. Stan Lee
is coming to do a signing on Thursday.

10
00:00:46,588 --> 00:00:49,128
(Sheldon:)Did he finally write a sequel
to his autobiography?

11
00:00:49,299 --> 00:00:53,089
(Sheldon:)I'm sure ages 79 through 87
were just action-packed.

12
00:00:53,261 --> 00:00:55,641
(Stuart:)No, just a regular comic signing.

13
00:00:55,805 --> 00:00:59,395
(Stuart:)My uncle is his dermatologist,
and Stan's doing him a favor.

14
00:00:59,559 --> 00:01:01,559
Oh, I don't wanna know that.

15
00:01:01,728 --> 00:01:05,188
(Sheldon:)How can I possibly discuss with
Stan Lee the scientific foundations...

16
00:01:05,356 --> 00:01:08,526
...for interstellar flight on a surfboard
when part of my brain...

17
00:01:08,693 --> 00:01:12,743
(Sheldon:)...will be scanning his face
for signs of contagious skin disease?

18
00:01:13,406 --> 00:01:16,656
(Leonard:)Stan Lee does not have
a contagious skin disease.

19
00:01:16,826 --> 00:01:20,166
(Sheldon:)Well, look who thinks
he's Stuart's uncle now.

20
00:01:20,830 --> 00:01:24,330
(Raj:)Can't believe it.
We're gonna meet Stan Lee.

21
00:01:24,501 --> 00:01:26,831
[THE POINTER SISTERS' "I'M SO
EXCITED" PLAYING OVER SPEAKER]

22
00:01:27,003 --> 00:01:29,003
(Raj:)I'm so excited
And I just can't hide it

23
00:01:30,840 --> 00:01:33,220
I'm about to lose control
And I think I like it

24
00:01:33,384 --> 00:01:39,024
(Howard:)I'm sad to say
I taught him those moves.

